= Instructions

Shake all ingredients with @Ice{}:
@Angostura 5 Year Rum{1 1/2 oz}, @Elderflower liqueur{1/2 oz}, fresh @Lemon juice{1/2 oz},
raw @Ginger syrup{1/2 oz}.

Strain into a #Collins glass{} over an @Ice{} spear. Top with @Soda{}.
Heavily top drink with @Angostura aromatic bitters{}.